  "name": "Doc IO Inbound Document Transformer",
  "description": "Applies transformation specifications to structured documents such as XML, JSON, or CSV, converting them into Oracle compliant schema format. It uses pregenerated transformation specifications such as XSLT or JOLT.",
  "specification": {
